-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"ff2e64c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Advanced anti-DDoS protection for all Virtual Server Hosting. Your servers are protected in real time without any increase in latency.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e23dbd8 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"e23dbd8\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7e650ac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7e650ac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33db295 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"33db295\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" src=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design__1_-removebg-preview.webp\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-3165\" alt=\"Windows and Linux VPS support icon\" srcset=\"/images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design__1_-removebg-preview.webp 128w, /images/wp-imported/webhosting.co.nz/uploads/2025/11/Untitled_design__1_-removebg-preview-100x100.webp 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b6a63ff e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"b6a63ff\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6b9237d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"6b9237d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" dat